  "translations": {
    "## Changelog - Automatic conversation translation with Captain or Google Translate. [Enterprise] - Conversation monitors, AI automation conditions, and label and priority suggestions. [Enterprise] - Refreshed Captain reports, Copilot chat history, and low-credit alerts. [Enterprise] - Captain toolset catalog and customer verific": "发布说明摘译：企业版增加通过 Captain 或 Google Translate 自动翻译会话、会话监控、AI 自动化条件，以及标签和优先级建议；更新 Captain 报告、Copilot 聊天历史和低额度提醒。后续说明被截断。",
    "## Changelog - Upgraded to Ruby 3.4.13 and hardened production Docker images. - WhatsApp call routing, wrap-up time, and business-hours controls. [Enterprise] - Fixed Copilot counts, date filters, links, and reply language. [Enterprise, Beta] - Reduced unnecessary Captain handoffs when waiting for customers. [Enterprise] - Impro": "发布说明摘译：升级 Ruby 3.4.13 并加固生产 Docker 镜像；企业版增加 WhatsApp 通话路由、通话后处理时间和营业时间控制；修复 Copilot 统计、日期筛选、链接和回复语言，减少等待客户时不必要的 Captain 转交。后续说明被截断。",
    "## Changelog > The Node.js vulnerabilities (notably CVE-2026-111497) did not affect Chatwoot’s production runtime. Node.js is used only to precompile JavaScript assets in the build step; the production application runs on Ruby and does not run Nodejs. We have nevertheless upgraded Node.js as a precaution. > We recommend upgradin": "发布说明摘译：发布说明称 Node.js 漏洞（特别是 CVE-2026-111497）不影响 Chatwoot 生产运行环境：Node.js 仅用于构建时预编译 JavaScript 资源，生产应用运行在 Ruby 上。团队仍预防性升级 Node.js，后续建议被截断。",
    "AI-powered, open-source customer support for live chat, email, WhatsApp, and social. Self-host or use our cloud: an alternative to Intercom and Zendesk.": "由 AI 辅助的开源客服平台，支持在线聊天、邮件、WhatsApp 和社交媒体。可自托管或使用云服务，定位为 Intercom 和 Zendesk 的替代方案。",
    "Chatwoot Blog: Customer Support Guides and Product News": "Chatwoot 博客与内容",
    "Chatwoot Changelog and Product Release Notes": "Chatwoot 文档与更新",
    "Chatwoot Pricing: Free, Cloud & Self-Hosted Plans": "Chatwoot 定价与方案",
    "Chatwoot: AI-Powered, Open-Source Customer Support Platform": "Chatwoot 官网",
    "README 内容摘录：___ # Chatwoot The modern customer support platform, an open-source alternative to Intercom, Zendesk, Salesforce Service Cloud etc. --- Chatwoot is the modern, open-source, and self-hosted customer support platform designed to hel": "README 摘录（中文）：现代化开源客服平台，定位为 Intercom、Zendesk 和 Salesforce Service Cloud 等工具的替代方案，支持自托管；后续介绍被截断。",
    "chatwoot/chatwoot": "Chatwoot 公开代码仓库",
