    "定价页中的原始片段：lf-hosted plans? Click here Hacker $0 /agent/month Up to 2 agents Get started free Conversations 500/m；er Data retention 30 days Startups $19 /agent/month Buy Startups Conversations Unlimited * Channels All；ntion 1 year Business Most popular $39 /agent/month Buy Business Conversations Unlimited * Channels All": "定价页摘录（中文）：Hacker 每名客服每月 0 美元，最多 2 名客服，摘录提及每月 500 次会话和 30 天数据保留。Startups 每名客服每月 19 美元，会话不限；摘录提及 1 年数据保留。Business 每名客服每月 39 美元，标注为热门方案，会话不限。"
